      "year": 2016,
      "abstract": "Planning for sustainable cities using, for example, microsensing networks requires thorough understanding and awareness of the issues that plague cities and rural areas, in developed and developing countries alike. These issues must first be identified and comprehended before investments in technology can be made to address them.",
