      "year": 2017,
      "abstract": "Mars has always been a source of fascination for humankind, and dreams of traveling to the Red Planet are common in literature. In the last 65 years however, increasingly realistic plans have been proposed. The history of projects for human Mars missions is a long one. The most important cases are summarized in this chapter.",
