    {
      "paperId": "/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-26215-0_3",
      "doi": "10.1007/978-3-030-26215-0_3",
      "title": "Simulation-Based Optimization",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Silja Meyer-Nieberg, Nadiia Leopold, Tobias Uhlig"
        }
      ],
      "year": 2020,
      "abstract": "This chapter provides an overview of some applications and research areas. First, some general points on using natural computing are discussed. Afterwards, approaches are presented in which a simulation model is directly coupled with an optimizer based on natural computing. These examples mostly concern the case of parameter optimization. As pointed out in several parts of the paper, conducting simulations is usually time-consuming. Therefore, efforts have been made to lower the frequency of simulation runs leading to surrogate assisted optimization which is described in the third subsection. The remaining parts of the chapter focus on two interesting application areas seldom covered in literature concerning simulation-based optimization: evolutionary data farming and applications for computer-games (also termed soft simulations). Especially in the case of the latter, the second potential use of natural computing for simulations comes into play: Many successful attempts in learning controllers from scratch stem from this area.",
      "abstract_not_available": false,
      "snippet": "This chapter provides an overview of some applications and research areas. First, some general points on using natural computing are discussed....",
      "citationCount": 0,
      "openAccess_pdf": {},
      "url": "https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-26215-0_3",
      "source": "Springer Nature Link",
      "rank": 52,
      "publicationTitle": "Natural Computing for Simulation-Based Optimization and Beyond",
      "publicationDate": "2020",
      "publicationDateSourceTag": "Springer rendered search-result Date published",
      "publicationDatePrecision": "year",
      "documentType": "Chapter",
      "openAccessLabelObserved": false,
      "sourcePublicationDate": "2020",
      "sourcePublicationDateBasis": "Springer rendered search-result Date published",
      "sourcePublicationDatePrecision": "year",
      "sourcePublicationDateConflict": false,
      "detailPublicationDate": "2019-07-27",
      "detailPublicationDateSourceTag": "First Online",
      "detailPublicationDateText": "First Online: 27 July 2019",
      "detailPublicationDateSource": "visible_detail_identifier_time",
      "detailPublicationDatePrecision": "day",
      "exactDateFilterStatus": "included",
      "query": "(\"CubeSat\" OR \"CubeSats\" OR \"cube sat\" OR \"cube sats\" OR \"cube-sat\" OR \"cube-sats\" OR \"cube satellite\" OR \"cube satellites\" OR \"nanosat\" OR \"nanosats\" OR \"nanosatellite\" OR \"nanosatellites\" OR \"nano-sat\" OR \"nano-sats\" OR \"nano sat\" OR \"nano sats\" OR \"nano-satellite\" OR \"nano-satellites\" OR \"nano satellite\" OR \"nano satellites\" OR \"SmallSat\" OR \"SmallSats\" OR \"small satellite\" OR \"small satellites\" OR \"small sat\" OR \"small sats\") AND (\"reference architecture\" OR \"reference architectures\" OR \"domain model\" OR \"domain models\" OR \"metamodel\" OR \"metamodels\" OR \"meta-model\" OR \"meta-models\" OR (\"product-line\" AND \"model\") OR (\"product-line\" AND \"models\") OR (\"product line\" AND \"model\") OR (\"product line\" AND \"models\") OR (\"product-family\" AND \"model\") OR (\"product-family\" AND \"models\") OR (\"product family\" AND \"model\") OR (\"product family\" AND \"models\") OR (\"variation point\" AND \"model\") OR (\"variation point\" AND \"models\") OR (\"variation point\" AND \"architecture\") OR (\"variation point\" AND \"architectures\") OR (\"variation points\" AND \"model\") OR (\"variation points\" AND \"models\") OR (\"variation points\" AND \"architecture\") OR (\"variation points\" AND \"architectures\"))"
