    {
      "paperId": "/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-77044-0_1",
      "doi": "10.1007/978-3-030-77044-0_1",
      "title": "Introduction to Satellite on-Board Data-Handling",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Pietro Nannipieri, Gianmarco Dinelli, ... Luca Fanucci"
        }
      ],
      "year": 2021,
      "abstract": "This chapter will introduce the basic concepts on the main building block of the data handling system of a spacecraft. We will introduce the main requirements which it has to withstand, also observing their evolution trends. The current operating solution in terms of on-board data-handling is illustrated, trying to focus on their strengths and weaknesses. Finally, we will present the candidate solution for next-generation satellite on-board data-handling.",
      "abstract_not_available": false,
      "snippet": "This chapter will introduce the basic concepts on the main building block of the data handling system of a spacecraft. We will introduce the main...",
